<title>MONACO: RALLYING-LIATTI WINS MONTE CARLO RALLY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-LIATTI WINS MONTE CARLO RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>MONTE CARLO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Piero Liatti, driving a Subaru Impreza, won the Monte Carlo world championship rally on Wednesday.</p>
